/*
 * Canonical source-semantic intrinsic registry.
 *
 * XA_INTRINSIC(id, numeric_id, key, family, lowering, effect, allocation,
 *              safety, min_arity, max_arity, flags,
 *              input_native, input_lanes, result_native, result_lanes)
 *
 * `key` is sealed compiler-owned declaration metadata. It is never
 * reconstructed from a call-site spelling, import
 * alias, display type name, or source path.
 */

